msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Rumor has it Kashiwagi of the Kazama Family was killed! That'll turn the "
"tide in the Nishikiyama Family's favor..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"It just goes to show that Kamurocho can't be tamed by weaklings like the "
"sixth chairman or Kashiwagi. It needs someone who ain't afraid to get "
"rough⑬someone like Kanda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"But the Nishikiyama Family's broke as shit. They don't have the power or the"
" resources to lead an organization like the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Not anymore. They've got the support of the Hakuho Clan now. Mine, the "
"chairman, owes Kanda big time, so they should have all the money they need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "No kidding...? I'm surprised he was able to win Mine over."
msgstr ""

